WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.020
The headline is two almost-sure convergence theorems.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:10.363
Theorem 1: momentum SGD iterates converge to a
connected set of stationary points.

00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:13.611
Theorem 3: standard AdaGrad does the same.

00:00:13.691 --> 00:00:18.330
Both strengthen earlier subsequence and
time-average results.
